speechtext:
1.	The following project for the centennial of confederation has been submitted to the Centennial Commission by a municipality in the constituency of Gatineau: (a) Project: Cultural Centre; (b) One has been presented and it has been accepted; (c) Location: Maniwaki;
(d)	Estimated cost: $100,000.
2.	The confederation motor caravan will visit Wakefield on October 15 and Maniwaki for two days on October 17 and 18, 1967.
